  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>RWA printed metrics were roughly flat this week:</strong> Distributed Value near $14.26B (-1.7% 30D). Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-senators-genius-act-rules-favor-federal-stablecoin-issuers?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Senators warn GENIUS Act rules could push stablecoin firms toward federal oversight</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li><li><strong>Tokenized U.S. Treasuries remain the institutional bridge into RWAs:</strong> adoption is strongest where products plug into cash management, collateral, and liquidity workflows. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/markets/2026-11-18-ondo-to-launch-tokenized-anthropic-stock-on-ipo-day-443482\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ondo to launch tokenized Anthropic stock on IPO day</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Tokenized T-bill supply is still expanding through new products:</strong> That usually shows up first as new issuer and product supply, then as higher distributed value and denser collateral-style use across networks and platforms. Related: <a href=\"https://thedefiant.io/news/research-and-opinion/nvidia-tokens-weekend-price-gaps-credora-redstone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">How Tokenized Nvidia Traded Through Two Weeks of Huang Headlines</a> (The Defiant).</li><li><strong>Regulatory framing still decides product access:</strong> Clearer rules tend to unlock balance-sheet participation and collateral workflows even when aggregate on-chain totals reprice slowly. Related: <a href=\"https://thedefiant.io/converge/tradfi-and-fintech/dbs-circle-add-24-7-institutional-usdc-access-in-asia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">DBS, Circle Add 24/7 Institutional USDC Access in Asia</a> (The Defiant).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
